{"seq":1,"slug":"geo-store-search","title":"地理位置门店搜索与距离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/omnichannel-nearby-stores/nearby-store/geo-store-search","wordCount":4174,"readingTime":17,"html":"<h1 id=\"地理位置门店搜索与距离\">地理位置门店搜索与距离</h1><p>给一家全国连锁算一笔账：门店总数一万家，每个城市平均几十到几百家。用户打开 App 请求「附近门店」，后台要在一万条记录里找出半径五公里内的那十几家，排序，返回，整个过程必须在几十毫秒内完成。如果只做一次，全表扫描也能跑完——一万行的距离计算在现代 CPU 上是毫秒级的事。真正让这个问题变难的是三件事：门店数会涨到十万甚至百万（考虑加盟、前置仓、自提点、快递柜）；每次请求的坐标各不相同，所以没有可复用的结果；以及延迟预算被压到不能再压，因为它发生在用户等待的首屏。于是「附近」从一个数学问题变成了一个索引问题。</p>\n<p>本文只处理几何层：坐标怎么表示、距离怎么算、索引怎么建、结果怎么排序与过滤。它不处理「这些门店里有没有货」——那是<a href=\"store-product-availability\">门店商品实时可售查询</a>的题目，本文给出的候选门店列表正是它的输入。它也不处理结果如何画到地图上、卡片上放什么字段——那是<a href=\"map-store-card\">地图与门店卡片展示</a>的题目。阅读时请把下游这两件事当成消费方：本文的产出契约是一组「门店 ID + 距离」的列表，其余都是别人的事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么-附近-不能靠排序解决\">核心概念：为什么「附近」不能靠排序解决</h2><p>一个常见的错误设计方案是把门店按距离排好序，然后二分查找。这个方案在概念上就错了，因为距离不是门店的固有属性——它依赖于用户坐标，而用户坐标是查询时才出现的。没有任何一个预先计算好的顺序能同时满足所有可能的查询点。</p>\n<p>正确的结构是<strong>空间索引</strong>：一种把二维（或三维）坐标映射到可高效剪枝的数据结构，使得「给定点 + 半径」这个查询不需要触碰全部数据。它要支持的操作只有两个，但这两个决定了全部设计：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户坐标 + 半径] --&gt; B[空间索引查询&lt;br/&gt;粗筛候选集]&#10;    B --&gt; C[精确距离计算&lt;br/&gt;对候选集逐个算球面距离]&#10;    C --&gt; D{距离 ≤ 半径}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[命中集合]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[丢弃&lt;br/&gt;粗筛多给的候选]&#10;    E --&gt; G[附加过滤条件&lt;br/&gt;营业状态/履约能力/可售]&#10;    G --&gt; H[排序&lt;br/&gt;距离 × 业务权重]&#10;    H --&gt; I[返回 门店ID + 距离 + 排序分]&#10;    I --&gt; J[下游: 可售查询]&#10;    I --&gt; K[下游: 地图渲染]\">graph TD\n    A[用户坐标 + 半径] --&gt; B[空间索引查询&lt;br/&gt;粗筛候选集]\n    B --&gt; C[精确距离计算&lt;br/&gt;对候选集逐个算球面距离]\n    C --&gt; D{距离 ≤ 半径}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[命中集合]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[丢弃&lt;br/&gt;粗筛多给的候选]\n    E --&gt; G[附加过滤条件&lt;br/&gt;营业状态/履约能力/可售]\n    G --&gt; H[排序&lt;br/&gt;距离 × 业务权重]\n    H --&gt; I[返回 门店ID + 距离 + 排序分]\n    I --&gt; J[下游: 可售查询]\n    I --&gt; K[下游: 地图渲染]</pre><p>这个两阶段结构（粗筛 + 精算）是空间查询的通用范式，它的正确性依赖一个性质：<strong>粗筛必须是超集</strong>。粗筛可以多给候选（精算阶段会淘汰），但绝不能漏掉任何一个满足条件的点，否则结果就是错的。这个「宁可多给、不可漏给」的约束会贯穿本文后面所有的索引取舍。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>查询复杂度</th>\n<th>写入复杂度</th>\n<th>距离精度</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n<th>主要缺陷</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全表扫描</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>千级以下</td>\n<td>规模上去必然超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网格分桶</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 近似</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>精确（扫 9 格）</td>\n<td>十万级</td>\n<td>密度不均时格子大小难定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>geohash 前缀</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 近似</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>精确（扫邻域）</td>\n<td>百万级</td>\n<td>边界问题需手工处理邻块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S2 单元格</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>亿级</td>\n<td>层级选择需要经验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>H3 六边形</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>亿级</td>\n<td>覆盖率与距离的均匀性取舍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>R 树 / GiST</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>百万级</td>\n<td>写入频繁时维护成本高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型的经验法则是：门店数量在十万以内、写少读多，网格分桶或 geohash 前缀配合数据库索引就够用，实现成本最低（数据库侧的空间索引即 PostGIS 在 GiST 上实现的 R 树，来源：PostGIS 文档 <em>Using PostGIS: Data Management</em>, <a href=\"https://postgis.net/docs/using_postgis_dbmanagement.html）；到了百万级或需要做邻域聚合、动态定价分区这类分析时，S2\">https://postgis.net/docs/using_postgis_dbmanagement.html）；到了百万级或需要做邻域聚合、动态定价分区这类分析时，S2</a> 或 H3 的层级化结构会带来额外收益。不要为了「看起来更专业」而直接上 H3——它的六边形几何会引入一整套额外的心智负担。</p>\n<h2 id=\"坐标表示与球面距离\">坐标表示与球面距离</h2><p>第一个必须纠正的直觉是：经纬度不是平面坐标，不能直接当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 用。</p>\n<p>把经纬度当平面做欧氏距离，在赤道附近的小范围内误差可以接受，但有两个地方会崩溃。第一是经度的尺度随纬度收缩：同样一度经度，在赤道约 111 公里，在北纬 60 度只有约 55.6 公里——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos(60°) = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">60°</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>（来源：Wikipedia, <em>Longitude</em>，一度经度在赤道为 111.320 km，随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span></span> 收缩, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Longitude）。所以在中国北方做半径查询时，用平面距离会系统性地把东西方向的范围算大一倍左右。第二是在经度\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Longitude）。所以在中国北方做半径查询时，用平面距离会系统性地把东西方向的范围算大一倍左右。第二是在经度</a> ±180 度的接缝处，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>179.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">179.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">179.9</span></span></span></span></span> 度与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>179.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-179.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">179.9</span></span></span></span></span> 度在平面上相距 359.8 度，实际只相距 0.2 度——这会让所有跨接缝的查询完全失效，太平洋上的岛国市场一定会踩到这个坑。</p>\n<p>正确做法是使用球面距离公式。最常用的是 haversine：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>arcsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>φ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>φ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>φ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = 2R \\arcsin\\sqrt{\\sin^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\Delta\\varphi}{2}\\right) + \\cos\\varphi_1 \\cos\\varphi_2 \\sin^2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\Delta\\lambda}{2}\\right)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.04em;vertical-align:-1.1561em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">arcsin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8839em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8719em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1208em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8719em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1208em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8439em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:3.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3240\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M473,2793\nc339.3,-1799.3,509.3,-2700,510,-2702 l0 -0\nc3.3,-7.3,9.3,-11,18,-11 H400000v40H1017.7\ns-90.5,478,-276.2,1466c-185.7,988,-279.5,1483,-281.5,1485c-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2c0,-1.3,-5.3,-32,-16,-92c-50.7,-293.3,-119.7,-693.3,-207,-1200\nc0,-1.3,-5.3,8.7,-16,30c-10.7,21.3,-21.3,42.7,-32,64s-16,33,-16,33s-26,-26,-26,-26\ns76,-153,76,-153s77,-151,77,-151c0.7,0.7,35.7,202,105,604c67.3,400.7,102,602.7,104,\n606zM1001 80h400000v40H1017.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1561em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是地球半径（取平均值 6371 km，来源：Wikipedia, <em>Earth radius</em>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earth_radius），$\\varphi$\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earth_radius），$\\varphi$</a> 是纬度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是经度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 表示两个坐标之差。haversine 对小距离的数值稳定性很好，是工程默认选择（来源：Wikipedia, <em>Haversine formula</em>，明确指出球面余弦定理在近距离下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos(d/R) \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 导致结果不准, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haversine_formula）。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haversine_formula）。</a></p>\n<p>它有一个容易被忽略的替代者——球面余弦定理：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>arccos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>φ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>φ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>φ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>φ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = R \\arccos\\big(\\sin\\varphi_1\\sin\\varphi_2 + \\cos\\varphi_1\\cos\\varphi_2\\cos(\\Delta\\lambda)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">arccos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>余弦定理在大距离上与 haversine 等价，但对小距离的精度差：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span></span></span></span></span> 值接近 1 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>arccos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\arccos</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">arccos</span></span></span></span></span> 的结果对输入的浮点误差极度敏感。两个相距 100 米的点在双精度浮点下可能算出 0 或 200 米。所以<strong>不要在门店搜索里用余弦定理</strong>，即使它在数学上更简洁。另外，如果需要亚米级精度（例如同一栋楼里的不同入口），球面模型本身就不够了，要用 Vincenty 或 Karney 的椭球公式（来源：Wikipedia, <em>Vincenty&#39;s formulae</em>，椭球解算精度约 0.5 mm, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vincenty%27s_formulae；Karney\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vincenty%27s_formulae；Karney</a>, <em>Algorithms for geodesics</em>, J. Geodesy 2013, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1109.4448）——但对「五公里内的门店」这类问题，球面误差（约\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1109.4448）——但对「五公里内的门店」这类问题，球面误差（约</a> 0.3%）远小于门店地址本身的定位误差，不值得投入。</p>\n<p>半径查询还有一个必须写下来的边界处理：<strong>大圆距离的半径上限</strong>是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>（约两万公里）。业务上不会出现，但代码里如果允许用户传入一个大得离谱的半径，公式会给出错误结果而不是报错。校验半径的范围（例如 0.1 km 到 500 km）是廉价且必要的防线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三类空间索引的取舍\">三类空间索引的取舍</h2><p>现在处理索引。三类做法各有清晰的适用场景，混用它们的代价很高。</p>\n<p><strong>网格分桶（geohash 的简化版）</strong> 把地球按固定经纬度步长切成格子，每个门店落在某格，查询时算出用户所在格并扫描它及其八个邻居。实现极其简单，用普通 B 树索引就能跑。它的致命弱点是格子大小固定而门店密度不均：城区一格里可能有几百家店，郊区一格里一家也没有。如果为了城区把格子切小，郊区就要扫很多空格；反之城区一格里候选太多，粗筛阶段就退化成了全扫。可以用多层网格缓解，但那就是在重新发明 geohash。</p>\n<p><strong>geohash</strong> 是网格分桶的递归版本：一个字符串前缀代表一个矩形区域，前缀越长区域越小（每加一个字符精度提高 5 位二进制，来源：Wikipedia, <em>Geohash</em>，base32 每字符编码 5 bit，8 位字符的位置误差约 ±19 m, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geohash）。它的好处是可以直接用字符串前缀匹配配合\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geohash）。它的好处是可以直接用字符串前缀匹配配合</a> B 树索引，几乎不需要特殊数据结构。它的问题在于<strong>边界</strong>：一个圆形的查询范围会跨越多个 geohash 前缀块，必须把邻块全部取出；而这些邻块的选取规则（奇数位与偶数位的邻居不同）容易写错。另一个问题是矩形与圆的差异——用 geohash 取到的候选是矩形的，粗筛多给的量在极端情况下可以达到圆面积的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 倍以上。</p>\n<p><strong>S2 与 H3</strong> 是工业级的层级化索引。S2 把球面投影到立方体的六个面再递归四分，单元格是四边形（在球面上是近似方形，来源：S2 Geometry Library, <a href=\"https://s2geometry.io/）；H3\">https://s2geometry.io/）；H3</a> 把球面切成六边形网格，因为六边形在邻域计算上只有一个距离概念（六边形的邻居中心距相等，而正方形有两个邻居距离、三角形有三个，来源：H3 官方文档 <em>Aggregation</em>, <a href=\"https://h3geo.org/docs/highlights/aggregation），而四边形的对角邻居比边邻居远\">https://h3geo.org/docs/highlights/aggregation），而四边形的对角邻居比边邻居远</a> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1328em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍——这让 H3 在「第 k 环邻居」「平滑的邻域聚合」这类操作上更自然，这也是它在地理分析、动态定价分区、骑手围栏里受欢迎的原因。</p>\n<p>选择它们的判据不是「谁的精度高」（都能到米级），而是「查询模式」：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[查询模式是什么] --&gt; B{需要邻域聚合&lt;br/&gt;或分区分析吗}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[H3: 六边形邻域均匀&lt;br/&gt;适合围栏/定价/热力]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{需要精确的&lt;br/&gt;矩形/多边形裁剪吗}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[S2: 层级四边形&lt;br/&gt;适合精确覆盖与区域∩]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F{门店数 &lt; 10万 且写少读多}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[geohash 前缀 + B树&lt;br/&gt;实现成本最低]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[S2 或 PostGIS GiST]&#10;    C --&gt; I[精算阶段仍需 haversine]&#10;    E --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[查询模式是什么] --&gt; B{需要邻域聚合&lt;br/&gt;或分区分析吗}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[H3: 六边形邻域均匀&lt;br/&gt;适合围栏/定价/热力]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{需要精确的&lt;br/&gt;矩形/多边形裁剪吗}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[S2: 层级四边形&lt;br/&gt;适合精确覆盖与区域∩]\n    D --&gt;|否| F{门店数 &lt; 10万 且写少读多}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[geohash 前缀 + B树&lt;br/&gt;实现成本最低]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[S2 或 PostGIS GiST]\n    C --&gt; I[精算阶段仍需 haversine]\n    E --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><p>无论选哪种，<strong>索引只负责粗筛，精确距离一律用 haversine 在精算阶段计算</strong>。把索引层级直接当成距离（例如「同一 geohash 前 7 位 = 大约 150 米内」）会引入不可控的误差，而且这种误差在不同纬度不一样——这是新手最常见的错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"查询执行-过滤-排序与分页\">查询执行：过滤、排序与分页</h2><p>拿到候选集之后，剩下的工作是把「几何命中」变成「业务可用」。</p>\n<p><strong>过滤条件的下推顺序</strong>决定性能。原则是把最便宜、选择性最强、最不需要外部依赖的条件放到最前面。典型顺序是：索引粗筛 → 半径精算 → 门店状态过滤（营业中/已打烊/暂停接单）→ 履约能力过滤（是否支持自提、是否支持即时配送）→ 可售过滤（最后，且通常是外部调用）。把可售放最后是因为它最贵——它需要查询另一个系统的库存，见<a href=\"store-product-availability\">门店商品实时可售查询</a>。如果先做可售再按距离过滤，会为大量距离根本不合适的门店付出昂贵查询。</p>\n<p><strong>排序</strong>很少是纯距离。业务上常见的综合排序把距离与一系列权重相乘或加权和，一种可用的形式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>履约</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>库存</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(i) = \\frac{w*{\\text{履约}}(i) \\cdot w*{\\text{库存}}(i)}{d(i) + \\varepsilon}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">履约</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">库存</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这种「距离取倒数」的结构天然给近距离高权重，同时避免除零。分母加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>（例如 0.1 km）避免用户正好在门店门口时分数爆炸。权重项的取值应当由数据拟合而非拍脑袋：把历史「用户最终选择了哪家门店」当成标签，看当前权重下被选门店的排序位置分布——如果真实选择经常不在前三位，说明权重配错了。</p>\n<p><strong>分页</strong>在空间查询里有一个反直觉的陷阱：不能简单地按距离偏移（<code>OFFSET</code>）。因为用户可能一边滚动一边改变坐标，或者两次请求之间门店状态发生变化，导致第二页出现第一页已经看过的门店（重复）或漏掉某些门店（跳漏）。可靠做法是<strong>游标分页</strong>：用「上一页最后一个门店的距离 + 门店 ID」组成游标，下一页从严格大于这个游标的位置继续。这样即使中间有数据变动，也不会重复；漏掉的最坏情况是新增门店，可接受。</p>\n<p><strong>结果数量</strong>也需要设计。返回太多门店没有意义（用户不会看第 50 家），返回太少可能在可售过滤后剩不下几家。务实的做法是索引阶段多取（例如取 200 家），过滤与可售后至少返回前 10 到 20 家，并在结果为空时逐级扩大半径重试（例如 5 km → 10 km → 20 km），把「扩大了半径」这个事实明确地传给下游用于界面提示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多市场与坐标数据的工程现实\">多市场与坐标数据的工程现实</h2><p>跨境场景给空间查询加了两个额外维度。</p>\n<p><strong>时区与营业状态</strong>：门店的「现在是否营业」依赖门店所在时区。一个统一按服务器时间判断的实现，会让跨时区市场的门店状态全错。正确做法是把门店的营业时间表达为「本地时间 + 时区标识」，在查询时用门店的时区计算当前本地时间再判断。这是一个看起来琐碎但极其常见的 bug 来源。</p>\n<p><strong>坐标系与精度</strong>：不同国家使用的坐标系不完全一致。中国境内使用 GCJ-02 加密坐标系，而 GPS 原始输出是 WGS-84，国际地图服务多用 WGS-84。如果用户坐标来自手机 GPS（WGS-84）而门店坐标来自地图服务商（GCJ-02），两者直接做距离计算会产生数百米的系统性偏移（来源：Wikipedia, <em>Restrictions on geographic data in China</em>，GCJ-02 相对 WGS-84 的偏移量约 100 到 700 米, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Restrictions_on_geographic_data_in_China）——在「五公里内找门店」的尺度上这不是致命错误，但在「一百米内哪个门店」的场景里完全不可用。工程做法是**在数据入口统一坐标系**，并把坐标系作为门店记录的一个字段显式存储，绝不隐式假设。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Restrictions_on_geographic_data_in_China）——在「五公里内找门店」的尺度上这不是致命错误，但在「一百米内哪个门店」的场景里完全不可用。工程做法是**在数据入口统一坐标系**，并把坐标系作为门店记录的一个字段显式存储，绝不隐式假设。</a></p>\n<p>另外两个数据质量问题必须在索引层就承认：<strong>门店坐标是近似的</strong>。门店地址解析（geocoding）给出的坐标可能是街道中心、可能是楼宇中心、也可能是整个商场的位置，误差从几十米到几百米不等。而商场里的门店更是如此——同一个商场里二十家店可能共享一个坐标。这导致「按距离排序」在商场场景下退化为「按随机顺序」。缓解手段是允许人工校准（门店管理员修正坐标），并对同一坐标聚集的多个门店做特殊处理（例如按楼层字段排序而不是按距离）。</p>\n<p><strong>坐标隐私</strong>是最后一个必须点明的约束。用户坐标是高敏感个人信息，它同时暴露了一个人「此刻在哪里」和「他常去哪里」。因此：坐标只在内存中用于本次查询，不落库到可关联到用户的表中；日志中记录坐标时必须降精度（例如截断到小数点后两位，约 1 公里）或直接不记；用于分析的坐标必须做聚合，不能保留单次请求的精确轨迹。这条约束的落地位置在查询接口本身，而不是在下游的数据处理策略里——因为它一旦写进日志就很难收回。这些原则的具体执行方式与整个平台的数据处理策略一致，本 hub 的其他几篇也遵循同一立场（见<a href=\"../member-unify/offline-data-attribution\">线下行为数据回流与归因</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>「附近门店」是一个<strong>空间索引问题</strong>，不是排序问题；索引提供粗筛超集，精确距离一律用 haversine 在精算阶段算。</li>\n<li>经纬度不能当平面坐标用：经度尺度随纬度按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span></span> 收缩，以及 ±180 度接缝问题，是两个必然踩到的坑。</li>\n<li>haversine 优于球面余弦定理，因为后者在小距离上数值不稳定；亚米级精度需求才值得上椭球公式。</li>\n<li>geohash 实现最简、S2 层级精确、H3 邻域均匀；选型看查询模式，不看「谁更先进」。</li>\n<li>过滤顺序是索引 → 距离 → 状态 → 履约 → 可售，把最贵的可售放最后；分页必须用游标而非偏移。</li>\n<li>多市场要处理时区化的营业时间与坐标系差异（GCJ-02 vs WGS-84）；门店坐标本身有几十到几百米误差，商场共址场景要特殊处理。</li>\n<li>用户坐标是高敏感数据，降精度或干脆不落日志，是查询接口自己的责任。</li>\n<li>几何层的产出（门店 ID + 距离）交给<a href=\"store-product-availability\">门店商品实时可售查询</a>补充事实层，再由<a href=\"map-store-card\">地图与门店卡片展示</a>完成表达层；门店库存的可靠性源头见<a href=\"../unified-inventory/store-online-inventory\">门店库存对线上实时开放</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"地理位置门店搜索与距离","id":"地理位置门店搜索与距离"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么「附近」不能靠排序解决","id":"核心概念-为什么-附近-不能靠排序解决"},{"level":2,"text":"坐标表示与球面距离","id":"坐标表示与球面距离"},{"level":2,"text":"三类空间索引的取舍","id":"三类空间索引的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"查询执行：过滤、排序与分页","id":"查询执行-过滤-排序与分页"},{"level":2,"text":"多市场与坐标数据的工程现实","id":"多市场与坐标数据的工程现实"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"门店商品实时可售查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/omnichannel-nearby-stores/nearby-store/store-product-availability"}}